  "asr_text_clean": "A boy and a monkey. Together they explored the jungle, laughed at silly jokes, and shared secrets. But when the boy grew up, he left, promising to return. Years passed. One day, a letter arrived. It read, *I\u2019m still here. Come find me.* The boy returned. The monkey waved. Old friends never truly say goodbye.",
